WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.240
We all want to eat
the kinds of foods

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.160
that make us feel
better and live longer.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.280
But there’s so much conflicting
information out there,

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.740
so many nutrition opinions.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.920
Welcome to the
Nutrition Facts Podcast,

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.720
I’m your host,
Dr. Michael Greger.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.420
It’s my job to give you
the information you need

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.912
to make the healthiest
choices possible.

00:00:21.912 --> 00:00:22.979
In the beginning,

00:00:22.979 --> 00:00:28.260
there was angiogenesis,
the creation of blood vessels.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.080
Tumors use it to keep growing.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:32.280
And as it turns out,

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.400
our fatty tissue also
needs it to expand.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:40.380
So, might an anti-angiogenic approach
work for weight loss too?

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:45.120
Many of our modern front-line
therapies against cancer incorporate

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.520
anti-angiogenesis strategies,

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:50.280
from the Greek words
"angio" meaning vessel,

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:51.720
and "genesis" meaning creation.

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:57.120
So anti-angiogenesis is opposing
the creation of blood vessels.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:01.260
In other words, fighting cancer
by cutting off tumor supply lines.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:05.160
Some cancers are only able to
grow to about the size of a tip

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.740
of a ballpoint pen
without a blood supply.

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:10.680
Tumor growth then stalls.

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:13.200
Autopsy studies show
that virtually everyone

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:16.020
has these tiny tumors
in them by age 70.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:19.140
Cancer without disease
can, therefore,

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.900
be considered the normal
state during aging.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.320
To commandeer a blood supply,
tumors diabolically release

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:28.320
angiogenic factors,
chemicals that cause

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:31.080
new blood vessels to
sprout towards the cancer.

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:34.500
Once a blood vessel reaches
the tumor and attaches,

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.000
it's off to the races ---

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.100
the tumor can then
take off exponentially.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.920
By starving cancer
of its blood supply,

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.900
chemotherapy that
blocks this process

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:44.880
can sometimes cause
tumors to shrink,

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:48.900
but ideally, we wouldn't have
to wait until such a late stage

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.040
to nip them in the bud.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.800
That's where our diet
can come in.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.160
Many of the phytonutrients
we know and love in tea, spices,

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.600
berries, broccoli, and beans
have anti-angiogenic properties.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.540
Given the power of plants,
the foundation

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:06.000
of an anti-angiogenic
approach to cancer

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.960
has been considered
a whole food plant-based diet.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:12.960
But the title of this video is

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:15.540
"Targeting Angiogenesis
to Lose Weight."

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:18.060
What does this have
to do with obesity?

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:21.600
Well, think about it.
Tumors aren't the only tissue

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:23.580
in the body with
expanding volume.

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.920
The average tumor picked
up by mammograms

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:27.480
is only about the
size of a marble,

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.940
and it can take breast cancer
decades to grow.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:32.880
Whereas overfeed people
and you can easily add

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:36.960
an entire pound of fatty tissue
in a matter of days.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:40.320
And body fat is highly vascularized.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.780
Each fat cell in our body
is essentially surrounded

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:46.440
by tiny blood vessels.
In large liposuction operations,

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:49.920
a third of what's vacuumed
out is straight blood.

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:54.720
Throughout adulthood, our fatty
tissue is constantly remodeling,

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:58.380
expanding and shrinking, based
on our day-to-day energy demand.

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:01.200
This requires the
development and retreat

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.600
of extensive networks
of new blood vessels.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:07.620
The human body already contains
60,000 miles of blood vessels.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.900
Imagine how many more miles
have to be constructed

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:13.140
when we gain weight.
Without angiogenesis,

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:15.480
without the sprouting of
all these new blood vessels,

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:17.580
we wouldn't be able
to add all that fat.

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:20.100
Now, do you see
where this is all going?

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:24.840
To expand, fat cells release
the same kinds of chemicals

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:27.240
that tumors do
to swell its blood supply.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:31.860
Fatty tissue is so angiogenic,
open-heart surgeons have even

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:35.160
tried grafting fatty tissue directly
on the heart after a heart attack

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:38.880
in hopes it would foster the growth
of arteries to bypass the blockages.

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:42.840
You can take fat samples from obese
individuals during bariatric surgery,

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:46.200
place them on living membranes
of fertile chicken eggs,

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:49.680
and within a week the fat is
literally engulfed in blood vessels.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:52.740
That may help explain
why excess body fat

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:54.720
can accelerate cancer growth.

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:58.080
Obesity increases the risk of more
than a dozen different cancers,

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:00.180
increasing the overall
risk of getting

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:02.340
and then dying from cancer
by about 20%.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:06.720
All those angiogenic factors
released from our increasing body fat

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.460
may spill out into our bloodstream,

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:11.580
resulting in higher blood levels
among overweight individuals,

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.100
which can then drop back down
when we lose weight.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.800
So maybe we could get
the best of both worlds

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:21.960
if we treated obesity like a tumor,
using anti-angiogenic strategies

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:25.080
to prevent the expansion of
our fat mass in the first place.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:31.740
There are anti-angiogenic drugs,
as well as anti-angiogenic foods.

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:35.706
We'll explore both, next.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.600
Body fat is probably the most
highly vascularized tissue

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:42.600
in the body, meaning it has
the most blood vessels.

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:45.240
In fact, each individual
fat cell is surrounded

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:47.700
by an extensive network
of tiny blood vessels.

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:50.160
And since the formation
of these blood vessels

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.080
appears to play a critical role

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.420
in fatty tissue growth
and reduction,

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.820
the regulation of angiogenesis,

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.980
the blood vessel
formation process,

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:01.980
may contribute to weight
gain and weight loss.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:06.480
So researchers tried injecting
anti-angiogenic drugs

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:09.420
into overfed lab animals
and were able to induce

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:14.700
profound weight loss in mice
as well as in nonhuman primates,

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:18.840
which is how scientists
often refer to monkeys.

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:21.780
The problem is that
anti-angiogenic drugs

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:24.840
can cause a variety of rare
but fatal side effects.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:27.720
We may be willing
to accept those risks

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.220
in the context
of cancer treatment,

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:32.220
but when it comes to cancer
prevention or obesity,

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:36.600
anti-angiogenic diets
would seem a safer bet ---

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.220
not to mention cheaper:

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:43.260
anti-angiogenic drugs
can cost $6,000 per dose.

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:48.060
So which foods are the
most anti-angiogenic?

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:50.880
It's interesting how they figured
out that dietary components

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.980
could be anti-angiogenic at all.

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:56.700
Realizing that those eating
plant-based diets were protected

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:59.520
from diseases of excess
angiogenesis like cancer

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.080
and diabetic vision loss,

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.780
researchers took a group
of plant-based eaters

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:06.840
and started pitting various
components of their urine

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.300
against the growth of
human blood vessel cells

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.720
harvested from discarded
umbilical cords.

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:15.420
The concentration of
phytonutrients in the urine

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:17.820
of vegetarians can
be 30 times higher

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:19.200
than that of the
general population.

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:22.200
Using this method,
they identified a number

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:25.440
of natural anti-angiogenic
compounds in our diet.

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:28.920
The question then became
could the levels required

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:31.980
to block angiogenesis
in a petri dish be reached

00:06:31.980 --> 00:06:34.080
in the bloodstream
after eating a meal?

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:38.160
The answer, researchers
soon realized, is yes.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:41.700
Anti-angiogenic concentrations
of broccoli compounds

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:44.160
can be reached in the
bloodstream within an hour,

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:46.920
eating less than three-quarters
of a cup of broccoli soup.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:50.760
So these are totally doable
kinds of quantities.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:53.100
You'll note most of these
compounds may be cleared

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.900
from our body within
6 hours, though,

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:57.780
and fall back to nearly
zero within 24 hours,

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:00.540
so we should strive to eat
cruciferous vegetables

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:01.620
at least once a day.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:05.940
Anti-angiogenic concentrations
of beta-cryptoxanthin can be

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:09.300
reached within hours of eating
two cups of red-fleshed papaya.

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:12.000
One and a quarter cup
of boiled onions may get you

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.400
an anti-angiogenic
dose of quercetin

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.620
circulating in your blood
in less than an hour.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.860
The level of protective
soybean compounds

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:21.720
that may be necessary
has been found

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:24.960
in the bloodstream of those
eating ordinary Japanese diets.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.480
Now, I'm not dreaming
up some sort

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:30.120
of broccoli-papaya-
onion-tofu casserole.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:34.020
These are just examples showing
anti-angiogenic concentrations

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.940
can be achieved within
your bloodstream

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:38.160
after eating a reasonable
serving size.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:42.360
In general, the most concentrated
dietary sources of polyphenols,

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:44.460
the class of phytonutrients
containing many

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:47.280
of the anti-angiogenic
compounds discovered to date,

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:49.500
are herbs and spices.

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:52.560
The only others to
place in the top ten

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:54.720
(out of more than
450 foods tested)

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:57.660
were berries, cocoa powder,
and ground flaxseed.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:01.800
On a per-serving basis, most of
the top contenders are berries,

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:04.560
with artichokes
leading the vegetables

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:07.740
and whole grain rye
leading the grains.

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:11.340
Ironically, yogurt is a leading
source in the United States,

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:14.220
but only because most
are fruit-flavored,

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.620
with many containing
berries as ingredients,

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:21.360
whereas even plain soy yogurt
makes it into the top 25.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:24.360
For cancer prevention,
researchers suggest

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:28.200
the constant consumption
of anti-angiogenic foods.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:30.840
Do we have evidence that
it's having an effect?

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:34.560
Well, based on the analysis
of more than a thousand tumors

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:37.200
from one of Harvard's studies
on male health professionals,

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:40.560
men eating the most tomato
products had significantly less

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:44.460
angiogenesis within their tumor,
which then appeared to translate

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:47.040
into a reduced risk
of fatal disease.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:50.580
Yeah, but would the same
anti-angiogenic potential

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:53.820
of fruits and vegetables also help
keep our bellies from growing?

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:56.700
There's only one way to find out.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:09:00.720
A meta-analysis of more than a
dozen randomized controlled trials

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:02.340
of fruits and vegetable
interventions for

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:05.460
overweight individuals found
6 extra pounds of weight loss,

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:08.580
but that could be from
a whole variety of factors,

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:11.640
like decreased calorie density
from the fiber and water content,

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:16.654
but maybe angiogenesis
inhibition is playing a role.

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:19.920
We would love it if you could
share with us your stories

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:22.680
about reinventing your health
through evidence-based nutrition.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:25.500
Go to nutritionfacts.org/testimonials.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:29.040
We may share it on our social
media to help inspire others.

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:35.100
To see any graphs, charts, graphics,
images, or studies mentioned here,

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:37.740
